    "heading": "Level 3: Warlock Subclass",
    "lineStart": 4263,
    "lineEnd": 4265
  },
  "section": "3.292",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Warlock subclass of your choice. The Fiend Patron subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Warlock levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Warlock level or lower."
}
